    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24168" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέσμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέω</span> A)
		poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσμός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bond, fetter,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιδήρεα δέσματ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.204
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.278
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>head-band,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ κρατὸς βάλε δέσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.468
				</span></i>
			.</div>
